The organisation logs and monitors the services and the IT that it runs, so that it detects security events in time and can investigate them.

== How to decide if this control is required

This control is required when the organisation runs IT or cloud services itself. If a supplier runs them, check that the agreement covers monitoring and the reporting of security events.

== How to implement

Define what is logged and monitored, who handles the alerts, and how long the logs are kept. Monitor the critical systems in the asset register. Protect the logs against change.

